 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves an [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901)
 and returns the referenced JSON value. The empty pointer returns the entire document. It throws if the
 pointer is malformed or does not refer to a value, including when an array index is invalid or out of bounds.
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+array and returns a new JSON document. It supports `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`;
+it throws when the patch is invalid or an operation cannot be applied. Neither the document nor the patch
+is mutated.
