+---
+id: task-002-implement-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+
+The function applies RFC 6902 JSON Patch arrays without mutating the supplied document. It supports
+the `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations, validates patch operations and
+JSON Pointer paths, and throws when validation or an operation fails. Tests cover successful changes,
+failure cases, pointer escaping, root replacement, array insertion and source-document immutability.
